1	// Seed attention forward kernel: FlashAttention-style online softmax, but
2	// deliberately scalar — no tensor cores, no cp.async, no arch-specific
3	// intrinsics — so it compiles for both sm_86 and sm_90a and leaves large
4	// optimization headroom. BF16 in/out, FP32 accumulation.
5	//
6	// Work partitioning: one block per (query tile, batch*head). 4 warps per
7	// block; each warp owns ROWS_PER_WARP query rows; within a row the 32 lanes
8	// cover the head dimension with D_PER_LANE consecutive elements each.
9	
